        <message_html><![CDATA[<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 620px; margin: auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 8px;">
  <div style="background-color: #c0392b; color: #ffffff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px;">
    <h3 style="margin: 0;">]]>🚨<![CDATA[ Equipment Disruption Alert</h3>
    <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px;">Diagnostic Device Under Maintenance or Unavailable</p>
  </div>
  <div style="padding: 20px 0;">
    <p>Dear <strong>Lab Operations & Biomedical Engineering Team</strong>,</p>
    <p>A diagnostic equipment asset required for processing patient lab tests has been placed in an unavailable state (maintenance schedule, Change Request, or operational outage).</p>
    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 15px 0;">
      <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;"><td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Affected Order:</td><td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold; color: #c0392b;">${report_number}</td></tr>
      <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;"><td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Test Investigation:</td><td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold;">${lab_test.name}</td></tr>
      <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;"><td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Assigned Equipment:</td><td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold; color: #c0392b;">${equipment.name}</td></tr>
      <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;"><td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Hospital Facility:</td><td style="padding: 8px 0;">${hospital.name}</td></tr>
      <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;"><td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Scheduled Window:</td><td style="padding: 8px 0;">${scheduled_start} - ${scheduled_end}</td></tr>
      <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;"><td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Current Test Status:</td><td style="padding: 8px 0;">${status}</td></tr>
    </table>
    <div style="background-color: #fdedec; border-left: 4px solid #c0392b; padding: 12px; margin: 15px 0;">
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px;"><strong>Recommended Actions:</strong></p>
      <ul style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 13px;">
        <li>Re-assign the test to an alternate operational equipment asset at this hospital.</li>
        <li>Reschedule the test slot or initiate the Patient Reschedule Offer (FL-03).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 10px; font-size: 12px; color: #999; text-align: center;">
    Apollo Hospitals Laboratory Information System (LIS).
  </div>
</div>
${mail_script:apollo_lab_team_recipient}]]></message_html>
